dnuos (1.0.13-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Fixed Opus and Ogg Vorbis files with large tags failing to be read.
  * Fixed "Too many open files" failures in directories with more than
    about 500 audio files on Windows.
  * Fixed audio files with paths of 260 or more characters being
    silently skipped on Windows.

 -- Josh Adams <xjoshx@gmail.com>  Fri, 30 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000

